#: ../adduser:915
#, perl-format
msgid ""
"%s: To avoid problems, the username should consist only of\n"
"letters, digits, underscores, periods, at signs and dashes, and not start "
"with\n"
"a dash (as defined by IEEE Std 1003.1-2001). For compatibility with Samba\n"
"machine accounts $ is also supported at the end of the username\n"
msgstr ""
"%s: probleemide vältimiseks peaks kasutajanimi koosnema ainult\n"
"tähed, numbrid, allkriipsud, punktid, märkide ja sidekriipsude juures, mitte "
"alata\n"
"kriipsuga (nagu on määratletud standardis IEEE Std 1003.1-2001). Ühilduvuse "
"tagamiseks Sambaga\n"
"masinakontod $ toetatakse ka kasutajanime lõpus\n"

#: ../adduser:1104
